  "intended_use": "Number (%) of subjects meeting each of a list of predefined criteria or status flags (disposition status and reasons, analysis-set membership, protocol-deviation categories, deaths and causes, AE overview categories, DLT, anti-drug antibody status, clinically notable thresholds). Rows may be nested and need not be mutually exclusive.",
  "not_for": "Distribution of one variable over exhaustive categories (variable summary template); dictionary-coded terms (coded-term template); category counts repeated by visit (parameter-by-visit template).",
